# Reach the block through normal gameplay so Arena initializes before combat.
# Juggernaut must attack; Birds is the only blocker and mana source.
# Leave Forest in hand and keep Full Control off to test the ordinary stop.
[metadata]
Name:Mana-only priority after declaring a blocker
Goal:Survive
Turns:5
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Leave Forest in hand, do not attack, and end your turn with Full Control off. Block Juggernaut with Birds of Paradise. Before damage, tap Birds for any color: it must still block, keeping your life at 20 even though Birds dies. Reset and decline blocking: no mana-only response stop should be forced, and you take 5.

